<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en" id="html-root">

<head>

    <meta charset="UTF-8">

    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=5.0, user-scalable=yes">

    <title><%= title %></title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/output.css">

    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <script>

        // ✅ IMMEDIATE theme application (prevents flash)

        (function() {

            const theme = localStorage.getItem('theme') || 'light';

            if (theme === 'dark') {

                document.documentElement.classList.add('dark');

            }

        })();

    </script>

    <style>

        .gradient-text {

            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6);

            -webkit-background-clip: text;

            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;

            background-clip: text;

        }

    </style>

</head>

<body class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 via-indigo-50 to-purple-50 dark:from-gray-900 dark:via-gray-900 dark:to-gray-800 min-h-screen font-inter">

    <!-- Use shared header partial -->

    <%- include('header') %>



    <div class="px-3 sm:px-4 py-6 sm:py-8">

        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">

            <div class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-2xl shadow-2xl dark:shadow-gray-900 border border-white/20 dark:border-gray-700 p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8">

                <div class="mb-6 sm:mb-8">

                    <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Create Your AI Twin</h1>

                    <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Complete the onboarding to create a twin that chats like you — based on your real messages, preferences, and rules.</p>

                </div>



                <!-- Enhanced Onboarding Steps -->

                <div class="mb-6 sm:mb-8">

                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-5 gap-3 sm:gap-4 text-center">

                        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">

                            <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-primary text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-semibold mb-2">1</div>

                            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">About You</span>

                        </div>

                        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">

                            <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-primary text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-semibold mb-2">2</div>

                            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">Chat Style</span>

                        </div>

                        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">

                            <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-primary text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-semibold mb-2">3</div>

                            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">Preferences</span>

                        </div>

                        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">

                            <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-primary text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-semibold mb-2">4</div>

                            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">Rules</span>

                        </div>

                        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">

                            <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-primary text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-semibold mb-2">5</div>

                            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">Preview</span>

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>



                <!-- Enhanced Onboarding Description -->

                <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg shadow-lg dark:shadow-gray-900 p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8">

                    <div class="text-center mb-6 sm:mb-8">

                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Enhanced Onboarding</h2>

                        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6">

                            This creates a more accurate twin by learning your real writing style, tone, interests, and boundaries.

                        </p>

                    </div>



                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:gap-4 md:gap-6 mb-6 sm:mb-8">

                        <div class="bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-6">

                            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 mb-3">

                                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">

                                    <span class="inline-flex w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/40 items-center justify-center">

                                        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">

                                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 8h10M7 12h6m-6 4h10M5 4h14a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2z"/>

                                        </svg>

                                    </span>

                                    <span>Real Message Samples</span>

                                </span>

                            </h3>

                            <p class="text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200">Paste how you actually chat (casual required, formal optional) so the twin matches your vibe.</p>

                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-900/20 rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-6">

                                                        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-green-900 dark:text-green-100 mb-3">
                                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
                                    <span class="inline-flex w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/40 items-center justify-center">
                                        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-green-700 dark:text-green-200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 20h9"/>
                                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16.5 3.5a2.1 2.1 0 013 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4 12.5-12.5z"/>
                                        </svg>
                                    </span>
                                    <span>Tone & Emoji</span>
                                </span>
                            </h3>

                            <p class="text-green-800 dark:text-green-200">Choose tone (polite/normal/casual) and emoji usage so replies feel natural.</p>

                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-purple-50 dark:bg-purple-900/20 rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-6">

                                                        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-purple-900 dark:text-purple-100 mb-3">
                                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
                                    <span class="inline-flex w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/40 items-center justify-center">
                                        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/>
                                        </svg>
                                    </span>
                                    <span>Topics & Interests</span>
                                </span>
                            </h3>

                            <p class="text-purple-800 dark:text-purple-200">Pick topics you like and topics to avoid to keep conversations comfortable.</p>

                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-orange-50 dark:bg-orange-900/20 rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-6">

                                                        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-orange-900 dark:text-orange-100 mb-3">
                                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
                                    <span class="inline-flex w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-orange-100 dark:bg-orange-900/40 items-center justify-center">
                                        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange-700 dark:text-orange-200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6M7 4h10a2 2 0 012 2v14l-4-2-4 2-4-2-4 2V6a2 2 0 012-2z"/>
                                        </svg>
                                    </span>
                                    <span>Rules & Reply Size</span>
                                </span>
                            </h3>

                            <p class="text-orange-800 dark:text-orange-200">Add always/never rules + reply length + engagement style. Preview before creating.</p>

                        </div>

                    </div>



                    <!-- Start Button -->

                    <div class="text-center">

                        <a 

                            href="/onboarding"

                            class="inline-block bg-primary text-white px-4 sm:px-8 py-2.5 sm:py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-secondary transition-colors font-semibold text-lg min-h-[44px] touch-manipulation text-base"

                            aria-label="Start Enhanced Onboarding"

                        >

                            Start Enhanced Onboarding

                        </a>

                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-3">Takes about 3–5 minutes</p>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>



</body>

</html>